Vendor icons
============

The SVG files in ui/icons/ are used only to identify providers in a local
usage page.

- claude.svg, deepseek.svg, doubao.svg, hunyuan.svg, kimi.svg,
  longcat-color.svg, minimax.svg, openai.svg, qwen.svg, tencent.svg,
  xiaomimimo.svg, zhipu.svg, alibaba.svg, bytedance.svg: from CC Switch
  (https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch), MIT license.
- qoder.svg, trae.svg, workbuddy-color.svg: from Magpie's
  @magpie-community/page-agent-office plugin.

All product names, logos and brands are the property of their respective
owners. They are used solely to identify the provider or model being measured.
